Package: consmodelling
Type: Project
Title: Australian Household Consumption ECM (Muellbauer-style)
Version: 0.1.0
Description: R replication of a Muellbauer/Duca-style integrated household
    consumption equation for Australia, with a parallel Italy benchmark.
    This DESCRIPTION is not a true installable package; it serves as a
    machine-readable manifest of direct package dependencies. The pinned
    versions of these dependencies (and their transitive closure) are held
    in renv.lock; restore the environment with renv::restore().
